    "enUS": {
      "description": "Ever strike a deal with a satyr, mon?\r\n\r\nI have. How could I resist? The promise of power, knowledge far exceeding what any ordinary tome could offer... all alongside an eager and charismatic minion. What more could I ask for?\r\n\r\nBah, of course they would never bend the knee to a mortal. I bargained when I had nothing, only to be cast aside with even less.\r\n\r\nNow, I want revenge. Revenge against the Hatefury. Raid their camp to the northeast! Stain the dirt with their foul blood.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Hatefury Hellcaller: {current}/{required}",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "Hatefury Felsworn: {current}/{required}",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "text": "Hatefury Rogue: {current}/{required}",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Defeat a variety of Hatefury satyr at Sargeron in Desolace and then return to Aka'rai in Shadowprey Village.",
      "title": "Hate the Hatefury",
